Outcome: success

Preference signals:

- The user explicitly asked for “the /tmp file for all these changes your methodology so i can give it to my agent” -> future similar requests should default to creating a self-contained, shareable handoff file.
- The user wanted something another agent could pick up directly -> future outputs should include prompts, scoring, exact observed errors, and implementation/test gates, not just a prose recap.

